---
description: Spec-driven development harness of this repository (always applies)
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root: it is the canonical instruction file for every coding
agent here. In short: read `docs/requirements/` first, find the current dossier with
`poetry run sdd status`, work only in its phase, never approve gates (people approve with
`sdd approve` at a terminal), never change code before G4, and update ADRs, diagrams with
official logos, READMEs and the teaching guide with every change.

Phase skills: `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`, also available as Cursor commands in
`.cursor/commands/` (generated by `poetry run sdd sync`).
